5,0,1,talk,Minato,,"Hello everyone! It's nice to meet you all. I'm a bit nervous, but I'll do my best. I wonder how this game works... let's all try to get along and find the werewolf together!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,It is a pleasure to meet you all as well. Let us maintain our composure; a calm mind is our best tool for uncovering the wolf. I look forward to a most intriguing game.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Servas,,It is a joy to be here with you all. Let us embrace this journey with open hearts and steady minds. Patience and kindness will guide us toward the truth. I wish us all a wonderful experience.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,May,,"Such a polite crowd! You're all being so formal that it's almost boring. Let's spice things up a bit, shall we? I'm ready to play, so let's see who's hiding a little secret!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,Stop being so formal! It's just a game. Let's just get to the point and find that werewolf before they start eating us. I'm not letting any of you slack off!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minato,,"@Takumi, you're so energetic! It's a bit scary, but I think it's great. I want to learn how to find the werewolf too. Does anyone have any ideas on where we should start?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,Perhaps we could begin by observing how each of us reacts to the pressure. The wolf often betrays themselves through over-eagerness or an unusual silence. Let us see who among us is truly anxious.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Observation is indeed a virtue, Benjamin. However, let us remember that anxiety can stem from many sources, not just guilt. Let us listen to one another with empathy; the truth often reveals itself in the quietest moments.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,May,,"Empathy is sweet, Servas, but it won't catch a wolf. I'm more interested in who's trying too hard to look innocent. For now, I'll just enjoy watching you all squirm!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@May, stop talking in riddles! If you're so smart, why aren't you actually suggesting something? I'm not just ""energetic,"" I'm the only one here actually trying to win!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minato,,"@May, you're very mysterious! I'm curious about what you mean by ""looking innocent."" Is there a special way to tell? I want to be helpful, so please teach me!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minato, your enthusiasm is charming, though I fear May enjoys the mystery more than the teaching. For now, let us simply observe. The first night's silence often speaks louder than these early words.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, the silence of the night holds its own wisdom. Let us not rush the process, for a seed needs time to grow before the fruit is revealed. Be patient with yourselves and each other.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,May,,"@Minato, you're just too cute! I'll tell you my secrets later, if you're lucky. For now, I'm just wondering why Benjamin and Servas are acting like they're in a philosophy class. It's a bit suspicious, don't you think?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Benjamin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@May, you're finally saying something useful! I agree, Benjamin and Servas are acting way too weird. All that talking about ""seeds"" and ""composure"" is just a distraction. Which one of you is hiding something?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""May"",""Benjamin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minato,,"@Benjamin, @Servas, are you two okay? You both talk so beautifully, but @Takumi and @May make it sound scary. I hope we can all just be friends and figure this out together!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Servas"",""Takumi"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minato, your kindness is a breath of fresh air. As for the ""scary"" accusations, I assure you that a preference for elegance is not a crime. I shall remain calm, regardless of the suspicions.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Servas,,"@Minato, your heart is pure, and that is a gift. @Takumi, @May, please do not mistake peace for a mask. I only wish for us to find clarity through harmony. Let us face tomorrow with hope.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Takumi"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,May,,"Harmony is all well and good, Servas, but hope doesn't stop a werewolf. You two are just too polished for my taste. I'll be keeping a very close eye on you both tomorrow!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm keeping an eye on you too, May! But Benjamin and Servas are still the weirdest ones here. Stop with the poetry and be ready, because tomorrow we're actually going to start hunting!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""May"",""Benjamin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,,action,Benjamin,Takumi,HUMAN,"{""action"":""divine"",""result"":""HUMAN"",""valid"":true,""raw"":""Takumi""}"
