31,1,1,talk,Minato,,"Good morning, everyone! I hope you all slept well. I'm a little sad that we have to suspect each other now... Did anything happen last night? I'm still a bit confused about how this works.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Good morning, Minato. To answer your question, the night is a time of secrets. While we slept, the Seer sought the truth and the wolf sought a victim. Let us see if anyone is missing.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Good morning, dear friends. It is a bittersweet awakening, for the dawn brings both light and the weight of suspicion. Let us remain gentle with one another as we seek the truth together.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,May,,"Still with the poetry, Servas? You're really committed to this act. I'm more interested in whether our Seer found something juicy last night. Anyone feel like sharing, or are we playing coy?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"@May, stop fishing for info! If the Seer is smart, they won't just blurt it out and get eaten tonight. Let's focus on who's acting fake. Benjamin and Servas are still being way too polished. It's annoying!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""May"",""Benjamin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Takumi, you're still so grumpy! But I think you're right that the Seer should be careful. @Benjamin, @Servas, do you think someone is acting fake? I want to help, but I'm not sure who to believe.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Benjamin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minato, it is natural to feel uncertain. While Takumi's bluntness is refreshing, his eagerness to point fingers so quickly can be a mask. However, logic suggests we examine the patterns of our discourse first.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Minato, do not let doubt cloud your spirit. Trust your intuition, but allow it to bloom slowly. @Takumi, your passion is a fire that can either light the way or burn the bridge. Let us seek balance.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,May,,"@Servas, you're still talking in circles! ""Allow it to bloom""? Give me a break. It's almost like you're trying to hypnotize us so we don't notice you're the wolf. @Benjamin, you're just as bad with your ""patterns of discourse."" Boring!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@May, for once, I totally agree! Servas is just trying to confuse us with those weird metaphors. @Servas, stop trying to ""balance"" things and just talk normally! You're acting way too suspicious for my liking.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Minato,,"@Servas, @Benjamin, please don't be sad that people are suspicious! I'm sure you're just being yourselves. But @May and @Takumi seem really sure... is there something we're missing? I don't want to pick the wrong person!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Benjamin"",""May"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minato, your empathy is commendable, but in this game, hesitation can be a luxury we cannot afford. @May and @Takumi are prioritizing aggression over analysis, which is a common tactic to divert attention.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""May"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Minato, your kindness is a light in this darkness. @Benjamin, you speak truth; aggression often masks a hidden agenda. Let us not be swayed by loud voices, but by the truth within.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, calling me aggressive is such a cliché! I'm just having fun. But look at you two, practically finishing each other's sentences now. It's almost like you've coordinated your ""elegant"" defense. How touching!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@May, you're right! They're totally backing each other up. @Benjamin, @Servas, you two are way too cozy. It's obvious you're trying to protect each other. One of you has to be the wolf!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""May"",""Benjamin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Minato,,"@Takumi, @May, please don't fight! It makes me feel sad. But if you're both so sure about Benjamin and Servas... I'll try to think carefully. I don't want to hurt anyone, but we have to find the wolf, right?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""May"",""Benjamin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minato, please do not be distressed. It is simply the nature of the game. @Takumi, @May, your insistence on ""coziness"" is a curious interpretation of mutual politeness. Perhaps you are projecting your own alliance?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Takumi"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Servas,,"@Minato, peace be with you. @Takumi, @May, it is a common human trait to see patterns where there are only coincidences. Let us not let suspicion blind us to the truth. I trust in our collective wisdom.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Takumi"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,May,,"""Collective wisdom""? Please. You're just trying to sound like a saint while you hide your claws. I'm not projecting anything, Benjamin; I'm just reading the room. And the room says you two are way too suspicious!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Benjamin, stop trying to flip this on us! We aren't an ""alliance,"" we just both see through your act. You and Servas are just hiding behind fancy words. I'm voting for one of you!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
