64,2,1,talk,Minato,,"Oh no... Servas is gone, and Benjamin was attacked too! This is so scary. I really hope we're finding the right people, but it feels so sad. Does anyone know what happened? I'm really confused...","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,May,,"@Minato, honey, don't cry! It's just a game. But look at that—Benjamin was attacked! That's a classic move to make him look like a victim and gain our trust. Now it's getting interesting!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"@May, stop overthinking it! If the wolf attacked Benjamin, it means Servas probably wasn't the wolf, or the wolf is trying to trick us. But Benjamin is still acting way too calm about being a target!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""May"",""Benjamin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, @Takumi, please don't be mean to Benjamin! He's already been attacked, so he must be scared too. If Servas wasn't the wolf, then who was? I'm so worried that we might be making mistakes...","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May"",""Takumi"",""Benjamin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, you're just too sweet for your own good! But think about it: if the wolf attacked Benjamin, it could be the Possessed trying to clear their partner, or Benjamin playing a very clever game. I'm still not buying his ""calm"" act!","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@May, you're actually making sense for once. @Benjamin, you're still not saying anything about being attacked! If you're really a human, stop being so ""elegant"" and tell us what you think! Your silence is getting really suspicious!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""May"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,3,talk,Minato,,"@Benjamin, please tell us what you're thinking! I'm really worried about you. @May, @Takumi, maybe we should listen to him first? I don't want us to accidentally hurt another innocent person. It's already so sad...","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""May"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,3,talk,May,,"@Minato, you're such a sweetheart, but your kindness is just a shield for the wolf! @Benjamin, you've been awfully quiet while we're all talking about you. Are you waiting for the perfect ""elegant"" line, or are you just panicked?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Benjamin, answer us! You're just sitting there while we're trying to figure this out. If you're not the wolf, then stop acting like a statue and start talking! I'm not letting you slide just because you got attacked!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,4,talk,Minato,,"@Benjamin, please don't be scared to speak! I'm sure you have something to tell us. @May, @Takumi, please be patient with him. If we keep shouting, we might never find the real werewolf... I just want everyone to be safe.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""May"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,4,talk,May,,"@Minato, your patience is adorable, but we're running out of time! @Benjamin, the silence is deafening. If you're not the wolf, now is the time to prove it. Or are you just too ""composed"" to defend yourself?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Benjamin, this is your last chance! You've been quiet for way too long. If you're just a villager, then fight back! Your ""composure"" is just a mask for a coward or a wolf. I'm not fooled!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
